  "description": "The contracts a plugin contributes to Kotoha through: operations rendered as an MCP tool\n            on one surface and a GraphQL field on the other, fields added to a contract type the\n            plugin does not own, its own types admitted as nodes of the schema, and the scalars it\n            claims by member name; the filter language service that compiles filter text into\n            Shoko's filter expressions and back; and the services that call Kotoha's tools and\n            receive its events in process. It carries no part of the engine that serves them.",
